{zoi zoi. borzoi .zoi} is not valid, because both the sound of {zoi} and the
text {zoi} exist within the qoute. To quote "borzoi", none of {by, bo, bor,
o, zy, zoi, borzoi, oi} made be used at all, and {zo} cannot be the
delimiter in written text, as per the CLL.

